<TeXmacs|1.99.9>

<style|tmweb2>

<\body>
  <tmweb-current|Help|Tutorials><tmweb-title|<TeXmacs>
  tutorials|<tmweb-help-links>>

  The following tutorials can be used to get started with <TeXmacs>. They
  were updated for <TeXmacs> 2.1.5 in 2026, with new screenshots; each one
  is also available as a PDF file (except the <name|Maxima> tutorial, which
  is still the one of 2005).

  <\itemize>
    <item><hlink|<TeXmacs> quick start guide|../documents/tutorials/TeXmacs-quick-start/TeXmacs-quick-start.en.tm>,
    an introduction by Nicolas Ratier, which fits on one A4
    (<hlink|PDF|../documents/tutorials/TeXmacs-quick-start/TeXmacs-quick-start.pdf>).

    <item><hlink|<TeXmacs> in 60 minutes|../documents/tutorials/TeXmacs-in-60-minutes/TeXmacs-in-60-minutes.en.tm>,
    a hands on tutorial by Andreas Seidl
    (<hlink|PDF|../documents/tutorials/TeXmacs-in-60-minutes/TeXmacs-in-60-minutes.pdf>).

    <item><hlink|A tutorial on the Maxima
    plug-in|../documents/tutorials/maxima-tutorial/maxima-tutorial.en.tm>, by
    Andrey Grozin.

    <item><hlink|A <TeXmacs> graphics tutorial|../documents/tutorials/TeXmacs-graphics-tutorial/TeXmacs-graphics-tutorial.en.tm>,
    by Henri Lesourd
    (<hlink|PDF|../documents/tutorials/TeXmacs-graphics-tutorial/TeXmacs-graphics-tutorial.pdf>).

    <item><hlink|Using plug-ins to insert technical
    figures|../documents/tutorials/TeXmacs-graphical-plugins/TeXmacs-graphical-plugins.en.tm>,
    by Nicolas Ratier
    (<hlink|PDF|../documents/tutorials/TeXmacs-graphical-plugins/TeXmacs-graphical-plugins.pdf>).

    <item><hlink|Customizing <TeXmacs>|../documents/tutorials/TeXmacs-customization/TeXmacs-customization.en.tm>,
    by Nicolas Ratier
    (<hlink|PDF|../documents/tutorials/TeXmacs-customization/TeXmacs-customization.pdf>).
  </itemize>

  The original versions of these tutorials (2003\U2005) are kept for
  reference: the <hlink|quick start guide|../documents/tutorials/original-tutorials/TeXmacs-quick-start.pdf>,
  <hlink|<TeXmacs> in 60 minutes|../documents/tutorials/original-tutorials/TeXmacs-in-60-minutes/tmtour.html>,
  the <hlink|graphics tutorial|../documents/tutorials/original-tutorials/TeXmacs-graphics-tutorial.pdf>,
  <hlink|using plug-ins to insert technical figures|../documents/tutorials/original-tutorials/TeXmacs-graphical-plugins.pdf>
  and <hlink|customizing <TeXmacs>|../documents/tutorials/original-tutorials/TeXmacs-customization.pdf>.

